If Hypothesis B (Any ritual or object of concentration is as good as any
another) is disproven, then we can go into more refined variations like
these:

 C. The object of concentration is irrelevant if the ritual is well-designed
 D. The design of the ritual is irrelevant if the object of concentration is
    well-chosen
